  "answer_text": "To regain CMA admin access when MFA is tied to a device you no longer have, reset MFA for the current admin. In CMA go to Account > Administrators, select the admin, and choose Reset MFA. The admin will be redirected to a QR code to re-enroll the authenticator app. After MFA is reconfigured, the replacement admin can sign in with CMA credentials and use MFA as configured. Note: MFA is required for CMA logins when using CMA credentials; if you log in via SSO, MFA may not be enforced.",
